Interstellar Escape Version3
1. Enriched the level content(including trial and official versions);
2. Optimized the interactive experience;
3. Updated promotional materials;
4. Added multilingual versions;
5. Discounts on prices;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45467288/6440156509d5841b62b7e8ce8711fa64f939910e.png[/img]Interstellar Escape "is a space themed film Rouge-like、 Simulated escape, absurd style game.
Players explore the civilization relics of the eight major planets by controlling their characters to run, jump, select (different attacks), collect (minerals), and solve puzzles (levels). They use strategies to fight against different enemies and finally achieve clearance.
The main attraction of the game is:
1. The story is absurd - the player (who is a child) challenges levels on the eight major planets just to earn spaceship fees to return home, discovering and harvesting the imprints of the past civilization along the way;
2. Rouge like design - Each time players enter the same level, the scene, items, civilization imprints, harvests, enemies, and so on are different;
3. Asymmetric confrontation - Players (as children) do not have powerful weapons, only escape and jump, use clones to explore, and choose different external tools to fight against a large number of enemies awakened by opening (necessary) switches.

